{"version":1,"key":"card:496","content":{"id":496,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d711b4dc-a4c4-45d4-aacb-a39bf440c8f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"长大了想回到童年，因为童年的大部分时间都是无忧无虑，不用承担责任，是自由的，是活泼的，是容易满足的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b40f955a-cb09-4aa2-90b5-9da0e3a47af5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是在小时候我们又想着快快长大，为什么想快快长大，小时候觉得大人是自由，想去哪去哪，想做什么就做什么，不用做作业，大人还有很多钱，但是这不是真相，大人完全不自由，几乎被工作束缚着，也无法做到想去哪就去哪，虽然有工资，但是花钱却需要考虑很多，买房，治病，不敢乱花，钱花的也不自由，花钱买东西也完全没有小时候的那种快感。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ec297c26-4bc2-4cd5-9f5c-5505e86e6c2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"长大后仿佛就完全失去了自由，看似有选择，但实际没有，比如工作也是随波逐流，选择最火的职业，选择最大的公司，完全没有想过自己想做什么，被社会和身边的人裹胁了，社会的氛围，家庭的氛围不允许你做出异常的行为，你反抗的代价也很高，所以大部分都不反抗了，不反抗没有困难，但是也失去了自由！"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a258c5ec-4190-4b5a-b18a-0c32235d90df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自由，成为了我现在最追求的东西。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"817281a2-95aa-4dad-9de1-038777be8a0d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"67a46415-a8eb-4bd4-b410-159a16801026","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"爱情诚可贵，生命价更高。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9ecdd17-4005-451f-90d5-0315910c9106","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"若为自由故，二者皆可抛。"}]}]}],"tags":["随笔"],"createTime":1724290384896,"updateTime":1762052456500,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1762052456500}}